sangati dosha

  "spanda-swarupa polarity-abheda svabhava-yukta"
  "vata-abheda pitta-abheda kapha-abheda"
  "shuddhi-phala kshaya-drishthanta domain-ayurveda-sthita"
  "panchabhootam-janya sambandha-siddha"

  shabda spanda, polarity, svabhava, vata, pitta, kapha, shuddhi, kshaya, panchabhootam, sambandha, domain-ayurveda

done
